<title>USA: Northwest to honor American tickets.</title>
<headline>Northwest to honor American tickets.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northwest Airlines Corp said Thursday that it is prepared to accept tickets for AMR Corp's American Airlines from passengers affected by a possible strike by American's pilots.</p>
<p>Northwest will be accepting the tickets immediately. Passengers with an electronic ticket reservation from American will have to obtain a paper ticket from American. Passengers using free travel award tickets will need authorizaiton from American before contacting Northwest, Northwest said.</p>
<p>The American pilots have set a midnight Friday strike deadline.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
